  "title": "Shrimp Creole II",
  "description": "This is an excellent dish that my mother makes. It has lots of vegetables in a thick Creole sauce. If you wish, you may also put sliced cheddar cheese on top before baking.",
  "authors": [
    "Sara"
  ],
